OL,3,ASusan Smith seeks parole again 32 years
OL,4,Aafter drowning her two sons
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South Carolina woman who admitted to
OL,7,Fdrowning her two sons 32 years ago is
OL,8,Frequesting, for a second time, to be
OL,9,Freleased on parole.
OL,11,FSusan Smith, 55, was convicted of
OL,12,Fkilling her boys by strapping them into
OL,13,Ftheir car seats and letting her vehicle
OL,14,Froll into a lake in 1994.
OL,16,FDuring her first parole hearing in
OL,17,F2024, Smith apologised to the
OL,18,Fseven-person parole board for the
OL,19,Fmurders and asked to be freed. The
OL,20,Fboard unanimously denied her request.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
